            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The central legal question is whether parents are considered aggrieved parties for purposes of the administrative process and thus may proceed pro se in court."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "05d47561fd0f2c28d42338d0046f44931a8b4870c47235a8defce500d886a8ab",
